==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Gory Darks are at a scarily threatening mag for your Labyrinth fodder to become pretty weak against. Try and use an anti-Dark Uber to sweep this without the risk of losing the level, or just an Uber with decently strong generalist stats.

[[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] at a decently high level, or with [[Talents]] invested, can comfortably solo this stage if you aren't bothered about losing her this early.

